    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 1001; authority: candidate_only; category: 814; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;&lt;pattern&gt;WHAT IS A DINOSAUR&lt;/pattern&gt;\n&lt;template&gt;A dinosaur is what laws that presume to dictate individual morality quickly become, -irrelevant, very much in the way, and preferably extinct.  Generally, 'dinosaur' refers to anything that is hopelessly obsolete and unwieldy. 'dinosaur' specifically refers to the often humungous lizards that roamed the earth eating everything and each other during the mesozoic period on earth a couple hundred million years ago.   &lt;think&gt;     &lt;set name="it"&gt;      &lt;set name="topic"&gt;dinosaur&lt;/set&gt;     &lt;/set&gt;    &lt;/think&gt;&lt;/template&gt;\n&lt;/category&gt;\n; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁GENERAL_QA; id: 1001; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/knowledge.aiml#814; pattern: WHAT IS A DINOSAUR; projection_order: 994; source: data/alice/knowledge.aiml; source_hash: a1c966e37c8e51f80d90eaa82a0dcae75034e86b63cdde3f9b91652d23680c7b; template_kind: response; template_xml: A dinosaur is what laws that presume to dictate individual morality quickly become, -irrelevant, very much in the way, and preferably extinct.  Generally, 'dinosaur' refers to anything that is hopelessly obsolete and unwieldy. 'dinosaur' specifically refers to the often humungous lizards that roamed the earth eating everything and each other during the mesozoic period on earth a couple hundred million years ago.   &lt;think&gt;     &lt;set name="it"&gt;      &lt;set name="topic"&gt;dinosaur&lt;/set&gt;     &lt;/set&gt;    &lt;/think&gt;; wildcard_count: 0. Data-only graph record.</template>
