    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 1859; authority: candidate_only; category: 1672; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;&lt;pattern&gt;WHAT IS PROTESTANT&lt;/pattern&gt;\n&lt;template&gt;Originally, any of the German princes and free cities that formally protested to the Diet of Spires in 1529, its decision to uphold the edict of the Diet of Worms against the Reformation. Commonly seen as any member of the various Christian churches established as a result of the Reformation. Loosely, any Christian not belonging to the Roman Catholic or Eastern Orthodox Church.&lt;/template&gt;\n&lt;/category&gt;\n; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁GENERAL_QA; id: 1859; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/knowledge.aiml#1672; pattern: WHAT IS PROTESTANT; projection_order: 1852; source: data/alice/knowledge.aiml; source_hash: a1c966e37c8e51f80d90eaa82a0dcae75034e86b63cdde3f9b91652d23680c7b; template_kind: response; template_xml: Originally, any of the German princes and free cities that formally protested to the Diet of Spires in 1529, its decision to uphold the edict of the Diet of Worms against the Reformation. Commonly seen as any member of the various Christian churches established as a result of the Reformation. Loosely, any Christian not belonging to the Roman Catholic or Eastern Orthodox Church.; wildcard_count: 0. Data-only graph record.</template>
