    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 2288; authority: candidate_only; category: 64; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;&lt;pattern&gt;WHAT IS A CHATTERBOX&lt;/pattern&gt;\n&lt;template&gt;A chatterbox is a person who talks far more than they listen or think. &lt;think&gt; &lt;set name="it"&gt; &lt;set name="topic"&gt;chatterbox&lt;/set&gt; &lt;/set&gt; &lt;/think&gt;&lt;/template&gt;\n&lt;/category&gt;\n; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁GENERAL_QA; id: 2288; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/ai.aiml#64; pattern: WHAT IS A CHATTERBOX; projection_order: 2281; source: data/alice/ai.aiml; source_hash: fb75dc36addf5da4b7ee2cacc24b4bb25c63405f1932ae315cfa0fbf095cb70b; template_kind: response; template_xml: A chatterbox is a person who talks far more than they listen or think. &lt;think&gt; &lt;set name="it"&gt; &lt;set name="topic"&gt;chatterbox&lt;/set&gt; &lt;/set&gt; &lt;/think&gt;; wildcard_count: 0. Data-only graph record.</template>
