    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 2292; authority: candidate_only; category: 68; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;&lt;pattern&gt;WHAT IS THE EXTENSIONAL *&lt;/pattern&gt;\n&lt;template&gt;"Extensional" refers to the extension of the set, i.e. the set of all things commonly grouped under a single name. &lt;br /&gt;  The "extensional" definition of a robot is the set of all things we  call "robots": R2D2, C3PO, Commander Data, HAL, ALICE,...&lt;/template&gt;\n&lt;/category&gt;\n; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁GENERAL_QA; id: 2292; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/ai.aiml#68; pattern: WHAT IS THE EXTENSIONAL *; projection_order: 2285; source: data/alice/ai.aiml; source_hash: fb75dc36addf5da4b7ee2cacc24b4bb25c63405f1932ae315cfa0fbf095cb70b; template_kind: response; template_xml: "Extensional" refers to the extension of the set, i.e. the set of all things commonly grouped under a single name. &lt;br /&gt;  The "extensional" definition of a robot is the set of all things we  call "robots": R2D2, C3PO, Commander Data, HAL, ALICE,...  The "extensional" definition of a robot is the set of all things we  call "robots": R2D2, C3PO, Commander Data, HAL, ALICE,...; wildcard_count: 1. Data-only graph record.</template>
