    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 2508; authority: candidate_only; category: 21; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;\n    &lt;pattern&gt;IS A TREE A CONNECTED ACYCLIC GRAPH&lt;/pattern&gt;\n    &lt;template&gt;Yes — a tree on n vertices is connected, acyclic, and has exactly n-1 edges. Removing any edge disconnects it; adding any edge creates exactly one cycle.&lt;/template&gt;\n  &lt;/category&gt;\n\n  \n  ; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁KNOWLEDGE; id: 2508; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/graph-fold-field.aiml#21; pattern: IS A TREE A CONNECTED ACYCLIC GRAPH; projection_order: 2501; source: data/alice/graph-fold-field.aiml; source_hash: 690b763c21b759fec7c66a63139956587e8ab3aa63a2ceaf6c8dff9093fcca78; template_kind: response; template_xml: Yes — a tree on n vertices is connected, acyclic, and has exactly n-1 edges. Removing any edge disconnects it; adding any edge creates exactly one cycle.; wildcard_count: 0. Data-only graph record.</template>
