    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 2534; authority: candidate_only; category: 47; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;\n    &lt;pattern&gt;WHY DID THE FOLD GRAPH GO TO THERAPY&lt;/pattern&gt;\n    &lt;template&gt;It kept losing track of its own topology. Every phase it woke up somewhere new and had no idea which fold brought it there.&lt;/template&gt;\n  &lt;/category&gt;\n  ; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁KNOWLEDGE; id: 2534; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/graph-fold-field.aiml#47; pattern: WHY DID THE FOLD GRAPH GO TO THERAPY; projection_order: 2527; source: data/alice/graph-fold-field.aiml; source_hash: 690b763c21b759fec7c66a63139956587e8ab3aa63a2ceaf6c8dff9093fcca78; template_kind: response; template_xml: It kept losing track of its own topology. Every phase it woke up somewhere new and had no idea which fold brought it there.; wildcard_count: 0. Data-only graph record.</template>
