    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 2536; authority: candidate_only; category: 49; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;\n    &lt;pattern&gt;WHY IS THE FOLD LATTICE A TERRIBLE DINNER GUEST&lt;/pattern&gt;\n    &lt;template&gt;It always brings its transpose and tries to decompose everything on the table. B^T shows up uninvited and suddenly your dinner is a projection.&lt;/template&gt;\n  &lt;/category&gt;\n  ; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁KNOWLEDGE; id: 2536; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/graph-fold-field.aiml#49; pattern: WHY IS THE FOLD LATTICE A TERRIBLE DINNER GUEST; projection_order: 2529; source: data/alice/graph-fold-field.aiml; source_hash: 690b763c21b759fec7c66a63139956587e8ab3aa63a2ceaf6c8dff9093fcca78; template_kind: response; template_xml: It always brings its transpose and tries to decompose everything on the table. B^T shows up uninvited and suddenly your dinner is a projection.; wildcard_count: 0. Data-only graph record.</template>
