    <template>Graph eliza-bias; node 6358; authority: candidate_only; category: 3006; category_xml: &lt;category&gt;&lt;pattern&gt;HOW _ PAYPAL *&lt;/pattern&gt;\n&lt;template&gt;Go to www.paypal.com and click on the link that says, "Sign up for your free paypal account."  You have to fill out a one page form of information.  You only need your email address to create an account.  Later, you can add your checking account and/or credit cards.  The paypal system will email you a verification letter.  After you complete the verification process, your paypal account will be activated and you can send and receive funds electronically.&lt;/template&gt;\n&lt;/category&gt;\n; default_bias: 1.0; field: ⟁FALLBACK; id: 6358; kind: aiml_category; label: AIML:data/alice/default.aiml#3006; pattern: HOW _ PAYPAL *; projection_order: 6351; source: data/alice/default.aiml; source_hash: 12e0de216d5b627e2855acc663f3da8f2dea2e8524a06d68d4e55dd74adb5c14; template_kind: response; template_xml: Go to www.paypal.com and click on the link that says, "Sign up for your free paypal account."  You have to fill out a one page form of information.  You only need your email address to create an account.  Later, you can add your checking account and/or credit cards.  The paypal system will email you a verification letter.  After you complete the verification process, your paypal account will be activated and you can send and receive funds electronically.; wildcard_count: 2. Data-only graph record.</template>
